# Screenshots

This folder contains screenshots of the **Guided Selling for Complex Products** project developed in ServiceNow.

## Screenshots Included

1. Application Creation
2. Complex Products Category
3. Guided Product Selection Catalog Item
4. Variables Configuration
5. Catalog UI Policy
6. Catalog Client Script
7. Decision Table
8. Flow Designer
9. Email Notification
10. Service Catalog Request Form
11. Request Submission
12. Flow Execution

## Purpose

These screenshots demonstrate the complete implementation of the project, from application creation to request processing and automation in ServiceNow.

They provide visual evidence of the project configuration and help users understand the workflow and implementation steps.
